# The image is built from cmd/, internal/, pkg/, web/ and one script alone.
# Everything else is kept out of the build context so that a change to it does
# not rebuild the image. A locally built web application is kept out too: the image builds its own.
.git
# All of .github but the one script the image's build runs: the installer that
# fetches the secrets scanner by pinned version and checksum.
.github/*
!.github/scripts
docs
examples
plugins
testdata
tools
**/node_modules
**/dist
web/e2e
web/test-results
web/playwright-report
deploy
